            {
                "entry_id": "7da7f114-54ea-3a80-99b6-e2b27e2ed8a3",
                "word": "antivax",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "01f95236-578b-4d15-8c75-aaf01ce00a0b",
                        "entry_id": "7da7f114-54ea-3a80-99b6-e2b27e2ed8a3",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "anti-vax"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c53ba9d3-3457-4c01-b96e-3f29e21adf38",
                        "entry_id": "7da7f114-54ea-3a80-99b6-e2b27e2ed8a3",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "antivaxx"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e3bc7e6-b56e-3df3-8dfe-3ba8bdef1288",
                        "entry_id": "7da7f114-54ea-3a80-99b6-e2b27e2ed8a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui s’oppose à la vaccination et remet en cause son efficacité ou son innocuité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "67c48ad7-78f7-46ea-81c0-c0e66caae73e",
                                "sense_id": "7e3bc7e6-b56e-3df3-8dfe-3ba8bdef1288",
                                "text": "Les différents groupes antivax qui agissent à travers le monde participent certes au problème, mais ils n’en sont pas la seule cause. Ils n’en sont peut-être même pas la cause principale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c91b30b-ce4e-4684-835d-4bbafb3eb661",
                                "sense_id": "7e3bc7e6-b56e-3df3-8dfe-3ba8bdef1288",
                                "text": "Oppositions religieuses, arguments écologiques, préventions contre une industrie Big Pharma et un État Big Brother… Si internet facilite aujourd’hui la diffusion de théories conspirationnistes, la plupart des courants « antivax » modernes reprennent des arguments nés dès le XVIIIe siècle. Pasteur lui-même ne fut-il pas en son temps accusé d’être un spéculateur vantant les mérites d’un procédé qui aurait fait plus de victimes que la maladie elle-même ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b742f90e-8a69-4e69-95a5-5dcf89edca90",
                                "sense_id": "7e3bc7e6-b56e-3df3-8dfe-3ba8bdef1288",
                                "text": "Dans une note du 19 juillet consacrée à l’«opposition aux mesures sanitaires prises dans le cadre de la lutte contre la Covid 19», le renseignement territorial (RT) met en garde contre le risque d’une radicalisation au sein de la nébuleuse antivax."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69936e4f-098b-4823-b712-d7ccf528ed37",
                        "source_entry_id": "7da7f114-54ea-3a80-99b6-e2b27e2ed8a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "7e3bc7e6-b56e-3df3-8dfe-3ba8bdef1288",
                        "target_lang_word": "anti-vax",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anti-vax",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb3a6b15-0fa3-370d-92f9-159bfd902d9d",
                                        "entry_id": "7811fb53-e829-3bc0-ac1e-c84e6fe9e39e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Opposing vaccines and vaccination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3eb9af05-94b6-42c9-bee6-d9bc03bf0aeb",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3a6b15-0fa3-370d-92f9-159bfd902d9d",
                                                "text": "And, indeed, fashion is already doing its part in the form of pro-vaxx and anti-vaxx T-shirts. Many of the anti-vaxx versions come pre-loaded with Libertarian subtext."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c0a9fa4-40bd-42ae-8976-0da4b4fc89e8",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3a6b15-0fa3-370d-92f9-159bfd902d9d",
                                                "text": "Online anti-vax communities, most of which are on Facebook, have taken on a very different tone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e32d1a7a-2570-49a4-ae56-cebfeb9af492",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3a6b15-0fa3-370d-92f9-159bfd902d9d",
                                                "text": "Donald Trump’s habit of projecting his own failings onto his adversaries reached a new level of absurdity on Labor Day, when he attacked the Democratic ticket of Joe Biden and Kamala Harris for “reckless anti-vaccine rhetoric” and accused them of a position that “undermines science.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4184e92a-2359-4dc6-9f77-a34d11fe405d",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3a6b15-0fa3-370d-92f9-159bfd902d9d",
                                                "text": "The anti-vaxx movement punches down and punches hard. Its leaders tend to be men and women from wealthy backgrounds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a1be4df-d103-4a43-ac26-5de2954f1333",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3a6b15-0fa3-370d-92f9-159bfd902d9d",
                                                "text": "Fernando’s sympathetic coverage of the protests and his coded anti-vax talk made him a folk hero among COVID denialists and anti-lockdowners, who would chant his name whenever he showed up at rallies, and even offer him cash."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
