                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9827345-df5f-30d9-84aa-19c1f6071782",
                        "entry_id": "25a37e98-2adf-330d-82d4-d855c6c1c1b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne ou mouvement opposée à certains vaccins ou à la vaccination en général, et qui remet en cause son efficacité ou son innocuité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55c0b953-27da-4053-9cb6-012ecbc8aee1",
                                "sense_id": "b9827345-df5f-30d9-84aa-19c1f6071782",
                                "text": "Pour la plupart des gens, l’origine de cette résurgence de la maladie ne fait pas trop de doute : c’est de la faute aux antivax, ces personnes qui s’opposent aux vaccins. « Les autorités fédérales en matière de santé attribuent l’épidémie de cette année aux parents américains qui refusent de vacciner leurs enfants », relevait l'agence Reuters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "894eb77a-c4e5-43bc-b591-33437f29c496",
                                "sense_id": "b9827345-df5f-30d9-84aa-19c1f6071782",
                                "text": "Un travail de longue haleine. Parcourir les groupes d’antivax à la recherche des plus belles \"perles\", opposer inlassablement aux antivax les données acquises de la science, répondre aux personnes qui s’interrogent sur les risques des vaccins…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5fa71e3-3a56-432c-8c03-baf3aa763d27",
                                "sense_id": "b9827345-df5f-30d9-84aa-19c1f6071782",
                                "text": "Anti-pass et antivax manifesteront pour la troisième fois demain samedi en France. Comme avec les Gilets jaunes, un même anti-élitisme leur sert souvent de liant."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "281f7161-08ee-4551-8aad-2c2af9363faa",
                        "source_entry_id": "25a37e98-2adf-330d-82d4-d855c6c1c1b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b9827345-df5f-30d9-84aa-19c1f6071782",
                        "target_lang_word": "Querdenker",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Querdenker",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "998d2da8-f6d1-3250-8542-6e50a360f7d6",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee06b60-a8e6-3cb3-9f86-9296c718d3c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die sich in ihrem Denken nicht an die üblichen Denkweisen hält"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af6ccbf9-de1d-4260-8af5-573f6effe512",
                                                "sense_id": "998d2da8-f6d1-3250-8542-6e50a360f7d6",
                                                "text": "Er war uns schon immer als Querdenker aufgefallen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "736f3f08-66d1-49f1-bb5e-a550bce19552",
                                                "sense_id": "998d2da8-f6d1-3250-8542-6e50a360f7d6",
                                                "text": "„Der Verfasser ließ keinen Zweifel daran aufkommen, daß eine Nation ohne Querdenker ebenso verarmen würde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e4e4a4e-e1b7-430b-8324-c8526e7b6e21",
                                                "sense_id": "998d2da8-f6d1-3250-8542-6e50a360f7d6",
                                                "text": "„Was die kreativen Querdenker aber keinesfalls daran hinderte, ihr einmal durchdachtes Konzept in die Tat umzusetzen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eacf370b-4a0a-4b71-af58-dea2eb80d979",
                                                "sense_id": "998d2da8-f6d1-3250-8542-6e50a360f7d6",
                                                "text": "„Kein Mobiltelefon, kein Notebook, kein GPS wäre je erfunden worden, wenn nicht Querdenker wie Einstein, Bohr oder Planck ihre Genialität darauf verwendet hätten, jahrhundertealte Vorstellungen über Raum und Zeit umzustürzen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8365c1c7-6c86-3680-8637-0a16c18615c2",
                                        "entry_id": "9ee06b60-a8e6-3cb3-9f86-9296c718d3c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die Maßnahmen des Staates zur Bekämpfung der Coronapandemie ablehnt und die sich dabei überwiegend auf Informationen beruft, die von Experten als falsch oder zu stark vereinfachend eingestuft werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c3f7d78-9455-471b-849a-1521863024f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "25a37e98-2adf-330d-82d4-d855c6c1c1b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b9827345-df5f-30d9-84aa-19c1f6071782",
                        "target_lang_word": "anti-vaxxer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anti-vaxxer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3a34d7f-d976-3cd7-882c-0f87a54b0bbb",
                                        "entry_id": "587a9464-4337-388d-80b9-367bf3bb6f5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who opposes vaccination, as for its purported dangerous effects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59673a2a-f348-41e9-b641-3fd16ee9a846",
                                                "sense_id": "b3a34d7f-d976-3cd7-882c-0f87a54b0bbb",
                                                "text": "Janice D'Arcy reports at the Washington Post on the latest measles outbreak traced back to anti-vaccination fanatics, but this time, instead of an outbreak being traced back to a Whole Foods or a nursery school---the usual places where the kids of yuppie anti-vaxxers have a chance to expose and be exposed---the trail for this one leads back to the Super Bowl."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f687239a-32ca-4dae-b24b-4aa295d449cf",
                                                "sense_id": "b3a34d7f-d976-3cd7-882c-0f87a54b0bbb",
                                                "text": "Like everyone else (other than anti-vaxxers, I guess), I was delighted to see the good news about the Pfizer vaccine hopefully being rolled out before Christmas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56929966-139c-4ba6-a796-a85f4e9e2460",
                                                "sense_id": "b3a34d7f-d976-3cd7-882c-0f87a54b0bbb",
                                                "text": "She acknowledged the existence of a “cohort of anti-vaxers”, as well as “valid” scepticism among other parts of society given the speed at which the vaccine has been developed. But the bigger issue, she said, will be how they manage a drip feed in supply."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08fee038-256b-4267-a734-b7043c4e96f2",
                        "source_entry_id": "25a37e98-2adf-330d-82d4-d855c6c1c1b5",
